      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/kearney_park_mississippi",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Loess-covered hills and minimal relief create rolling uplands 50 to 150 feet above floodplains, giving Kearney Park its gently rolling topography.",
